er","atoms":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/majapacking-copy.lsg","sound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>telephone-ringing-tone-1</voice>"}},{"trainer":"content","instruction":"Listen.","textAlign":"left","design":"dialogue","atoms":[{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/majapacking-copy.lsg"},{"text":"","sound":"Hey Bella, I am packing right now, but I feel like I am forgetting some things. Can you help me?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f7_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/adults/maja.lsg"},"position":"right"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"No problem, what is in your suitcase so far?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f9_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/bestfriend.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"I have some t-shirts, shorts, an umbrella, a raincoat and a bikini.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f7_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/adults/maja.lsg"},"position":"right"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"What?! We’re going on a beach holiday to Spain — not Ireland! You don’t need to pack anything for rainy weather.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f9_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/bestfriend.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Yeahhh... you’re right. I’ll take those things out of my suitcase then. Oh, what about a camera so that we can take photos of our holiday?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f7_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/adults/maja.lsg"},"position":"right"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Don’t worry, I already have one in my suitcase, you can leave yours at home.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f9_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/bestfriend.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"button":"Continue"}]},{"trainer":"findAll","instruction":{"text":"Find."},"soundMode":"a","onSamePageOnce":true,"finishButton":false,"atoms":{"a":"Which items should <b>not</b> be in Maja’s suitcase?","sound":"Which items should not be in Maya’s suitcase?","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/majasuitcase.lsg","width":400},"objects":[{"class":"1","color":"transparent","correct":true},{"class":"2","color":"transparent","correct":true},{"class":"3","color":"transparent","correct":true}]}},{"trainer":"multipleChoice","instruction":{"text":"Choose. More than one answer can be correct."},"soundMode":"a","shuffleButtons":true,"onSamePage":true,"atoms":{"a":"What are Bella and Maja packing for?","sound":"What are Bella and Maya packing for?","b":["++They are going on a beach holiday.","They are going to Ireland.","++They are going to Spain.","They are going on a city break."]}},{"trainer":"content","instruction":"Listen.","textAlign":"left","design":"dialogue","atoms":[{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/packinglists-bf-text.lsg"},{"text":"","sound":"I’ve just sent you my packing list, can you see it?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f9_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/bestfriend.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Yes, thank you! I definitely need to remember to pack my cap and sunglasses.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f7_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/adults/maja.lsg"},"position":"right"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Don’t forget suncream too! You need to protect your skin from the sun and make sure you don’t get a sunburn!","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f9_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/bestfriend.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"I think there is a bottle in my bathroom cupboard! Thank you so much for helping me out.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f7_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/adults/maja.lsg"},"position":"right"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"No problem, I love packing! I am also taking headphones and a puzzle book so I don’t get bored while we are at the beach.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f9_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/bestfriend.lsg"},"position":"left"},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"I think I’ll bring something to read instead... I just don’t find puzzles very relaxing.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f7_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/adults/maja.lsg"},"position":"right"},{"button":"Continue"}]},{"trainer":"kidCards","onSamePageOnce":true,"instruction":"Choose.","shuffleAtoms":true,"lsg":{"width":140},"cards":[{"id":1,"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/bestfriend.lsg"},{"id":2,"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/adults/maja.lsg"}],"atoms":[{"solution":[2],"instruction":"Who doesn’t like puzzles?"},{"solution":[2],"instruction":"Who likes reading?"},{"solution":[1],"instruction":"Who loves packing?"},{"solution":[1],"instruction":"Who is packing headphones?"}]},{"trainer":"kidCards","shuffleAtoms":true,"shuffleCards":false,"instruction":{"text":"What does Maja pack?","sound":"What does Maya pack?"},"onSamePageOnce":true,"cards":[{"id":1,"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/book.lsg"},{"id":2,"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/glasses.lsg"},{"id":3,"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-06-transport-and-travel/block-03-packing-my-suitcase/lsg/trunks.lsg"},{"id":4,"lsg":"/../c-en